sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Pipeline.askAgent
  participant O as OpenCode 1.19.3
  participant G as Controller gateway
  participant N as NVIDIA endpoint
  P->>O: Phase prompt / one active turn
  loop OpenCode generation retry (observed six requests per failed turn)
    O->>G: Logical streaming chat request
    G->>N: Initial outbound attempt
    alt HTTP 429
      N-->>G: Throttled
      loop While HTTP 429 and request is not aborted
        Note over G: Honor Retry-After, else 2/4/8/16/30 seconds
        G->>N: Retry outbound attempt
        N-->>G: Next status / eventual response stream
      end
    else HTTP 200 stream
      N-->>G: Response frames, possibly an embedded error 500
    end
    G-->>O: Forward response bytes as they arrive
    Note over G: BUG at clean EOF: HTTP 200 is marked completed<br/>Structured stream error is not classified
    Note over O: Recognize embedded error / back off
  end
  O-->>P: Terminal model error after SDK retries
  Note over P: Retry whole turn after 5/10/.../60 seconds<br/>Restart OpenCode every third failure<br/>No repeated-provider-error circuit breaker
  P->>O: Repeat phase prompt
